    <string name="summary_bocce">A calm team contest of rolling close to the jack, forgiving on many outdoor surfaces.</string>
    <string name="summary_croquet">Guide a ball through hoops while position and interference turn a lawn into a puzzle.</string>
    <string name="summary_gateball">A timed team mallet game with quick turns, three gates, and tactical ball contact.</string>
    <string name="summary_horseshoes">A familiar stake game built around ringers, leaners, and the nearest shoe.</string>
    <string name="summary_kubb">Teams topple wooden guards before taking the king in a lively rectangular court battle.</string>
    <string name="summary_lawn_bowls">Curving bowls reward pace, reading the green, and a patient route toward the jack.</string>
    <string name="summary_molkky">Score exactly fifty by choosing between one valuable pin and a spreading cluster.</string>
    <string name="summary_petanque">Plant both feet, pitch the boule, and decide when to place or knock an opponent away.</string>
    <string name="summary_quoits">Pitch rings at a fixed pin; clean landings and close rests make every round legible.</string>
    <string name="summary_ring_toss">Simple equipment and short range make this the gentlest invitation onto the ground.</string>
    <string name="summary_shuffleboard">Send discs down a long lane, balancing scoring distance against the risk of a knock.</string>
    <string name="summary_skittles">A compact striking game where a measured throw sends stout wooden pins tumbling.</string>
    <string name="summary_washer_pitching">Portable boxes turn a small yard into a precise pitching lane in minutes.</string>
